``` List IAM users seen in the training dataset. Adapted from original notes. ```
index=client3 sourcetype="aws:cloudtrail" "userIdentity.type"=IAMUser
| stats count by userIdentity.userName
| sort userIdentity.userName

``` Separate search: inspect API events whose recorded MFA context is false.
This is an investigation filter, not a standalone compromise detection. ```
index=client3 sourcetype="aws:cloudtrail" userIdentity.sessionContext.attributes.mfaAuthenticated="false" NOT eventName="ConsoleLogin"
| table _time eventName userIdentity.userName sourceIPAddress

``` Separate search: identify ACL events mentioning the AllUsers group.
Inspect the full ACL and bucket configuration before deciding actual exposure. ```
index=client3 sourcetype="aws:cloudtrail" eventName="PutBucketAcl" AllUsers
| table _time eventID requestParameters.bucketName userIdentity.principalId
